		<method name="trainset_determine_type">
			<return type="void" />
			<param index="0" name="vehicle" type="RID" />
			<description>
				Determines what the trainset coupled to [param vehicle] carries, from its cars (the vehicles without power) and their brake delays, and gives every vehicle of the trainset that type: a car with R, or without G, carries passengers; one with G and without R, goods. The type stays until it is determined again. The legacy driver determines it where the original judges its train (AutoRewident(), Driver.cpp:2154-2165).
			</description>
		</method>
