				Sets [param pantograph] of [param vehicle] as it is built ([code]TAnimPant[/code]): where it stands in the vehicle's own space, the arms' lengths, the horizontal offset between their ends, their angles lowered and the slider's height over its pivot. Given by whoever draws the vehicle. The server raises the pantograph on its step; a model rebuilt sets it again and the raise is kept.
			</description>
